{% load public_url_tags %}
{% comment %}
One advisory as the trust center lists it.

Shared by the landing page's recent-advisories panel and the full feed so the
two cannot drift. Expects `advisory` (a trust_center projection) and
`workspace` in context.
{% endcomment %}
<c-branded.list-row href="{% public_url 'core:advisory_details_public' workspace_key=workspace.key advisory_id=advisory.pk %}" level="{{ advisory.severity|default:'none' }}">
<c-slot name="eyebrow">
{{ advisory.id }}
{% if advisory.is_gated %}
    <c-branded.badge brand title="Visible to you because you have access to the affected products">
    <i class="fas fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>Restricted
    </c-branded.badge>
{% endif %}
{% if advisory.is_withdrawn %}<c-branded.badge tone="medium">Withdrawn</c-branded.badge>{% endif %}
</c-slot>
<c-slot name="heading">{{ advisory.title }}</c-slot>
{% if advisory.summary %}<c-slot name="summary">{{ advisory.summary }}</c-slot>{% endif %}
<c-slot name="meta">
{% if advisory.cve_ids %}
    <span><i class="fas fa-bug" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ advisory.cve_ids|join:", " }}</span>
{% endif %}
{% for product in advisory.products %}<c-branded.badge>{{ product.name }}</c-branded.badge>{% endfor %}
{% if advisory.withheld_product_count %}
    <c-branded.badge title="Products you do not have access to are not listed">+{{ advisory.withheld_product_count }} not shown</c-branded.badge>
{% endif %}
</c-slot>
<c-slot name="side">
<c-branded.badge tone="{{ advisory.severity|default:'none' }}">{{ advisory.severity_label }}</c-branded.badge>
{% comment %}
Resolved is the one status a reader scanning the list needs to spot without
reading, so it is a badge and every other status stays a line of muted text.
Success tone rather than the severity spine, which still says how bad the
issue was: the badge answers the other question, whether it is still open.
The tick carries the same meaning as the colour for anyone who cannot see it.
{% endcomment %}
{% if advisory.status == 'resolved' %}
    <c-branded.badge tone="success">
    <i class="{{ advisory.status_icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ advisory.status_label }}
    </c-branded.badge>
{% elif advisory.status_label %}
    <span><i class="{{ advisory.status_icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ advisory.status_label }}</span>
{% endif %}
<span>{{ advisory.published_display|default:advisory.updated_display }}</span>
</c-slot>
</c-branded.list-row>
